      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IF I WAS YOU (3) is hard to fault. Just missed here two back then was an easy winner here last time in similar grade over a little further. Has the claim and a low draw and kept fresh for the sharper trip. Looks the one to beat. MR MARRAKECH (1) resumed four weeks ago over 1200m at this track and was only beaten 1.2 lengths into fourth after being in the firing line on the bend. Fitter and sure to take catching. TIME TO BACA (4) was out of the money two runs back then again missed the frame last start over 1200m at this track, beaten 2.5 lengths into fourth. Won't find this as tough so she is one of the main contenders. PATRIOTIC KING (2) has won second up before and can improve sharply.",
